1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:07,810
Two impressive robot videos may use different hands, objects, starting states, and definitions of success.
两段精彩机器人视频，可能使用完全不同的条件。

2
00:00:08,410 --> 00:00:13,790
Bench2Dex builds a shared simulation protocol so policy comparisons become more meaningful.
Bench2Dex建立共享仿真协议，让策略比较更有意义。

3
00:00:14,549 --> 00:00:21,210
The benchmark contains twenty-six bimanual task-and-hand settings and supports twelve dexterous-hand embodiments.
基准包含26个双手任务手型设置，支持12种手。

4
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:25,390
This does not mean every task is evaluated with all twelve hands.
这不意味着每个任务都评测全部12种手。

5
00:00:25,912 --> 00:00:32,452
A surface-aligned ray-casting pipeline maps local contact geometry into image-like tactile observations.
表面对齐的射线投射把局部接触几何转成触觉图。

6
00:00:33,072 --> 00:00:37,532
Different hand shapes can therefore share a consistent sensing format inside the simulator.
不同手型由此在仿真中共享一致感知格式。

7
00:00:38,231 --> 00:00:45,571
About thirteen hundred teleoperated demonstrations accompany synchronized visual, tactile, and robot-state data.
约1300条遥操作示教提供同步视觉、触觉和状态。

8
00:00:46,051 --> 00:00:52,691
Executable success checks specify the terminal outcome, while separate metrics describe progress through task stages.
可执行成功检查约束最终结果，阶段进度另行统计。

9
00:00:53,434 --> 00:01:00,654
The study evaluates four policies across four perturbation channels, with fifty attempts per setting and channel.
四策略、四扰动通道，每设置每通道50次。

10
00:01:00,994 --> 00:01:06,554
Together that is twenty thousand eight hundred simulation episodes under a common experimental design.
统一设计共20800个仿真评测回合。

11
00:01:07,164 --> 00:01:13,309
Across channels, GR00T N1.5 averages twenty-eight point three percent
通道平均GR00T N1.5为28.3%，

12
00:01:13,324 --> 00:01:16,184
and pi-zero-point-five twenty point three.
π0.5为20.3%。

13
00:01:16,644 --> 00:01:18,489
ACT reaches eighteen percent
ACT为18%，

14
00:01:18,504 --> 00:01:20,986
and Diffusion Policy seven point one.
扩散策略为7.1%。

15
00:01:21,436 --> 00:01:27,856
Under combined distribution changes, the leading two scores are nineteen point eight and nineteen point seven.
组合分布变化下，前两名为19.8%和19.7%。

16
00:01:28,176 --> 00:01:33,276
That difference amounts to only two successful episodes, not convincing broad superiority.
只相差两次成功，不能据此声称明显优势。

17
00:01:34,059 --> 00:01:41,599
The shared tactile interface represents contact geometry; it does not reproduce one particular physical sensor.
共享触觉接口表示接触几何，并不复现特定真实传感器。

18
00:01:41,979 --> 00:01:48,219
Real hardware still adds calibration, friction, sensor noise, and control delays that need separate validation.
真机还需单独验证标定、摩擦、噪声和控制延迟。

19
00:01:48,872 --> 00:01:52,917
Bench2Dex contributes the testing conditions, data, and metrics
Bench2Dex贡献测试条件、数据与指标，

20
00:01:52,932 --> 00:01:55,492
rather than a new winning manipulation policy.
而非一套新的获胜操作策略。

21
00:01:55,972 --> 00:02:01,172
Its strongest use is controlled comparison before committing to more expensive physical experiments.
它适合先做受控比较，再进入成本更高的真机实验。
